<title>USA: Commercial Federal completes acquisition.</title>
<headline>Commercial Federal completes acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA, Neb. 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Commercial Federal Corp said Thursday its Commercial Federal Bank unit completed its previously announced acquisition of of Investor Federal Savings, of Kinsley, Kansas.</p>
<p>The $32 million asset bank was acquired for $23 a share and had 232,465 outstanding shares, Commercial Federal said.</p>
<p>Shares of Commercial Federal, which has $1.8 billion in assets, rose 3/4 to 34-1/4 Thursday.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
